/T (Compounding these challenges is the procedural complexity of the Senate itself. Unlike the House of Representatives, where majorities can more easily assert control, the Senate operates under rules that empower minority factions and encourage extended debate. Mechanisms such as the filibuster and cloture transform the legislative process into a test of endurance and negotiation, requiring not only numerical support but also strategic coordination. As a result, the success of H.R. 101 will depend not solely on its substantive merits but on the ability of its proponents to navigate the institutional constraints of the chamber. )
/E (Compounding these challenges is the procedural complexity of the Senate itself. Unlike the House of Representatives, where majorities can more easily assert control, the Senate operates under rules that empower minority factions and encourage extended debate. Mechanisms such as the filibuster and cloture transform the legislative process into a test of endurance and negotiation, requiring not only numerical support but also strategic coordination. As a result, the success of H.R. 101 will depend not solely on its substantive merits but on the ability of its proponents to navigate the institutional constraints of the chamber. )
