803 0 obj
<<
/Title (The United States Senate now finds itself at the center of an intense legislative confrontation, as it assumes responsibility for evaluating a series of bills transmitted by the House of Representatives. At the forefront of this agenda stands H.R. 101, the American Opportunity and Infrastructure Act, a comprehensive proposal that seeks to allocate unprecedented federal funding toward the modernization of national infrastructure, expansion of clean energy initiatives, and promotion of economic opportunity. While proponents argue that such investment is essential to stimulate growth and address long-standing structural deficiencies, opponents raise significant concerns regarding the scale of public spending and the mechanisms proposed to finance it.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 798 0 R
/Next 808 0 R
>>
endobj
804 0 obj
<<
