808 0 obj
<<
/Title (However, the debate surrounding H.R. 101 extends far beyond its immediate policy provisions. At its core, the bill has become a symbolic battleground for broader ideological disputes regarding the role of the federal government in shaping economic and social outcomes. For many Senators, the legislation represents a necessary intervention to address systemic inefficiencies, regional disparities, and the long-term sustainability of national infrastructure. For others, it embodies an overextension of federal authority, raising concerns about bureaucratic expansion, fiscal irresponsibility, and the potential displacement of private sector initiative.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 803 0 R
/Next 812 0 R
>>
endobj
